@sheet Data
@header | Team | Jobs | Hours |
| A | 4 | 8 |
| B | 5 | 14 |
| C | 6 | 16 |

@sheet Dashboard
@header | Label | Value | Note |
| ## Ops Dashboard | < | < |
| Total jobs | =SUM(!!Jobs) | ok |
| Total hours | =SUM(!!Hours) | ok |
| Avg hours | =SUM(!!Hours)/SUM(!!Jobs) | ok |

@sheet Notes
@header | Metric | Value |
| Board total | =Dashboard!B3+Dashboard!B4 |
| Avg copy | =Dashboard!B5 |
